<item><title>Zimbabwe to roll out irrigation pumps on farms against El-Nino</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-to-roll-out-irrigation-pumps-on-farms-against-el-8fa982/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-to-roll-out-irrigation-pumps-on-farms-against-el-8fa982/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>The government will supply pumps to every farm with irrigation facilities, a move Agriculture Minister Auxious Masuka tied to the President&apos;s rural tractor programme.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:28:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-to-roll-out-irrigation-pumps-on-farms-against-el-8fa982/share.jpg" length="42420" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-to-roll-out-irrigation-pumps-on-farms-against-el-8fa982/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Zimbabwe, UK deepen UN Security Council cooperation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-uk-deepen-un-security-council-cooperation-302441/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-uk-deepen-un-security-council-cooperation-302441/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>UK officials are in Harare for a two-day dialogue to prepare Zimbabwe for its 2027-2028 UN Security Council tenure.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:25:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" length="34422" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
